	measure '_Selected Scenario (Multiple options) Title | Suppression' = ```


		VAR __Is_Scenario_Filtered = ISFILTERED ( 'TBL Scenario Selection'[Name] )

		VAR __Concatenated_Scenarios =
		    CONCATENATEX (
		        'TBL Scenario Selection',
		        'TBL Scenario Selection'[Name], ", ",
		        'TBL Scenario Selection'[ID], ASC
		    )

		VAR __Result =
		    "AC" & 
		        IF (
		            __Is_Scenario_Filtered,  ", " & __Concatenated_Scenarios
		        )

		RETURN __Result
		```
